    "end": "2026-07-14T21:00:00",
    "url": "",
    "location": "Revere High School, 3420 Everett Road, Richfield, OH 44286",
    "image": "<img src=\"/revize/plugins/_editforms_/v2/images/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"/>",
    "rid": "103",
    "id": "103",
    "desc": "%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%22color%3A%20%23236fa1%3B%22%3EThe%20venue%20has%20changed%20to%20the%20Revere%20High%20School%20auditorium%20due%20to%20the%20high%20heat%20index%21%21%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3EJoin%20the%20Richfield%20Historical%20Society%20on%20July%2014%3Csup%3Eth%3C%2Fsup%3E%20from%207-9%20PM%20as%20the%2040-piece%20Akron%20Symphonic%20Winds%20orchestra%20presents%20%26ldquo%3BHAPPY%20BIRTHDAY%20AMERICA%26rdquo%3B%2C%20a%20program%20celebrating%20America%26rsquo%3Bs%20Semiquincentennial%20and%20filled%20with%2020%20of%20our%20favorite%20patriotic%20marches%20and%20show%20tunes%20including%2076%20Trombones%2C%20The%20Armed%20Forces%20Medley%2C%26nbsp%3B%20The%20Washington%20Post%20March%2C%20A%20Copland%20Tribute%2C%20The%20Sound%20of%20Music%20and%20ending%20with%20a%20rousing%20rendition%20of%20Stars%20and%20Stripes%20Forever.%26nbsp%3B%20The%20concert%20promises%20to%20be%20one%20of%20the%20highlights%20of%20the%20Society%26rsquo%3Bs%20Semiquincentennial%20programing%21%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3EThe%20program%20is%20scheduled%20to%20be%20held%20at%20the%20pavilion%20on%20the%20Richfield%20Village%20green.%26nbsp%3B%20We%26rsquo%3Bre%20hoping%20for%20good%20weather%2C%20but%20if%20it%20turns%20inclement%20the%20venue%20will%20change%20to%20the%20Revere%20High%20School%20auditorium%20%283420%20Everett%20Road%29.%26nbsp%3B%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3C%2Fp%3E"
